From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Schultz <alexschultz002@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 01:29:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(regex.c): doxygen and lookaround comments

Hand port of 5f1e19de and f337ea63 onto the patched tree, with audit verdicts:
- @file: describe rstr (rstr patch) next to rset.
- re_pikevm(): utf8_length['\n'] is only zeroed/restored when it is not already 0; otherwise REG_NEWLINE is dropped and the caller restores it (threaded_search).
- lookaround cache note: the nested VM no longer resets utf8_length[eol_ch], so the re-zeroing is defensive.
- compilecode(): cap_stack holds words (s64), not ints.
- rset_smake() is now defined here (upstream moved it out of vi.h); its brief moves along.
Comments only; stripped binary identical.
---
 regex.c | 127 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 110 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

